Package: vigiar
Type: Package
Title: VIGIAR Environmental Health Data for Rio de Janeiro
Version: 0.7.1.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Ryan",
           family = "Santos",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "ryan.paulo@gsuite.iff.edu.br",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-6770-2001")))
Author: Ryan Santos
Maintainer: Ryan Santos <ryan.paulo@gsuite.iff.edu.br>
Description: Downloads, processes, validates, and audits environmental
    health surveillance data from Brazil's VIGIAR (Vigilancia em Saude
    Ambiental) public Power BI dashboard, maintained by the Brazilian
    Ministry of Health, with a verified workflow for the 92 municipalities
    of Rio de Janeiro. Provides annual and monthly PM2.5 processing,
    municipality-year-month completeness, official six- and seven-digit
    IBGE code validation, server-side partitioning, parser and truncation
    evidence, critical-schema locks, structured online audit artifacts,
    logging, caching, and versioned snapshots with SHA256 checksums. The
    package prepares and diagnoses aggregate public data; it does not
    validate causal or predictive models.
